	  PLACEHOLDER. Push notifications stay switched off until this is replaced.

	  To enable prep reminders on iOS:
	    1. Firebase console → project `weekly-food-planner-fire-14e00` → Add app → iOS
	    2. Bundle ID: in.khanakyabanau.app
	    3. Download the generated GoogleService-Info.plist and overwrite this file
	    4. Apple Developer → Keys → create an APNs auth key (.p8) and upload it to
	       Firebase → Project settings → Cloud Messaging

	  PushService.looksReal() checks for the REPLACE_ME sentinel and skips
	  FirebaseApp.configure() while it is present, so the app runs fine without it.
	-->
